// The app's version, the one place it is set. It is the base configuration of the project, so every target inherits it.
// release-please rewrites the line between the markers in each Release PR (release-please-config.json, extra-files);
// tools/release.sh refuses to build a tag whose version differs from the built app's.
// x-release-please-start-version
MARKETING_VERSION = 2.0.3
// x-release-please-end
